{"verse_key": "13:2", "surah": 13, "verse": 2, "text_uthmani": "ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِى رَفَعَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ بِغَيْرِ عَمَدٍ تَرَوْنَهَا ۖ ثُمَّ ٱسْتَوَىٰ عَلَى ٱلْعَرْشِ ۖ وَسَخَّرَ ٱلشَّمْسَ وَٱلْقَمَرَ ۖ كُلٌّ يَجْرِى لِأَجَلٍ مُّسَمًّى ۚ يُدَبِّرُ ٱلْأَمْرَ يُفَصِّلُ ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ لَعَلَّكُم بِلِقَآءِ رَبِّكُمْ تُوقِنُونَ", "translation": "It is Allāh who erected the heavens without pillars that you [can] see; then He established Himself above the Throne<sup foot_note=196541>1</sup> and made subject<sup foot_note=196540>2</sup> the sun and the moon, each running [its course] for a specified term. He arranges [each] matter; He details the signs that you may, of the meeting with your Lord, be certain.", "verse_from_ms": 0, "verse_to_ms": 35210, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "ٱللَّهُ", "start_ms": 35210, "end_ms": 36130}, {"i": 1, "text": "ٱلَّذِى", "start_ms": 36130, "end_ms": 37040}, {"i": 2, "text": "رَفَعَ", "start_ms": 37040, "end_ms": 38750}, {"i": 3, "text": "ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ", "start_ms": 38750, "end_ms": 39640}, {"i": 4, "text": "بِغَيْرِ", "start_ms": 39640, "end_ms": 40550}, {"i": 5, "text": "عَمَدٍ", "start_ms": 40550, "end_ms": 40870}, {"i": 6, "text": "تَرَوْنَهَا", "start_ms": 40870, "end_ms": 41170}, {"i": 7, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 41170, "end_ms": 41430}, {"i": 8, "text": "ثُمَّ", "start_ms": 41430, "end_ms": 43090}, {"i": 9, "text": "ٱسْتَوَىٰ", "start_ms": 43090, "end_ms": 46130}, {"i": 10, "text": "عَلَى", "start_ms": 46130, "end_ms": 47040}, {"i": 11, "text": "ٱلْعَرْشِ", "start_ms": 47040, "end_ms": 50780}, {"i": 12, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 50780, "end_ms": 52080}, {"i": 13, "text": "وَسَخَّرَ", "start_ms": 52080, "end_ms": 56030}, {"i": 14, "text": "ٱلشَّمْسَ", "start_ms": 56030, "end_ms": 57160}, {"i": 15, "text": "وَٱلْقَمَرَ", "start_ms": 57160, "end_ms": 58450}, {"i": 16, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 58450, "end_ms": 59220}, {"i": 17, "text": "كُلٌّ", "start_ms": 59